{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"GLPI-Project.GLPI-Agent","latestVersion":"1.21","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.dc817870.png","priority":1,"sha256":"dc8178709df038d3a90455d563a62fcb9085146afb45a615b108860ab08f4291","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"The GLPI Agent is a generic management agent. It can perform a certain number of tasks, according to its own execution plan, or on behalf of a GLPI server acting as a control point.","license":"GPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/glpi-project/glpi-agent/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"The GLPI Agent is a generic management agent. It can perform a certain number of tasks, according to its own execution plan, or on behalf of a GLPI server acting as a control point.","license":"GPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/glpi-project/glpi-agent/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"The GLPI Agent is a generic management agent. It can perform a certain number of tasks, according to its own execution plan, or on behalf of a GLPI server acting as a control point.\nThis agent is based on a fork of FusionInventory agent and so works mainly like FusionInventory agent. It introduces new features and a new protocol to communicate directly with a GLPI server and its native inventory feature. Anyway it also keeps the compatibility with FusionInventory for GLPI plugin.","moniker":"glpi-agent","name":"GLPI Agent","packageUrl":"https://github.com/glpi-project/glpi-agent/releases/","publisher":"Teclib'","publisherUrl":"https://glpi-project.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/glpi-project/glpi-agent/blob/HEAD/Changes","tags":["glpi"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"GLPI Agent 是一个通用的管理代理，可以根据自己的执行计划或作为 GLPI 服务器的一个控制点来执行一定数量的任务。","license":"GPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/glpi-project/glpi-agent/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"GLPI Agent 是一个通用的管理代理，可以根据自己的执行计划或作为 GLPI 服务器的一个控制点来执行一定数量的任务。\n该代理是 FusionInventory 代理的一个分叉，因此工作原理与 FusionInventory 代理类似。它引入了新功能和新协议，可直接与 GLPI 服务器及其本地库存功能通信。无论如何，它还可以通过 FusionInventory for GLPI plugin 保持兼容性。","name":"GLPI Agent","packageUrl":"https://github.com/glpi-project/glpi-agent/releases/","publisher":"Teclib'","publisherUrl":"https://glpi-project.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/glpi-project/glpi-agent/blob/HEAD/Changes","tags":["glpi"]}},"longDescription":"The GLPI Agent is a generic management agent. It can perform a certain number of tasks, according to its own execution plan, or on behalf of a GLPI server acting as a control point.\nThis agent is based on a fork of FusionInventory agent and so works mainly like FusionInventory agent. It introduces new features and a new protocol to communicate directly with a GLPI server and its native inventory feature. Anyway it also keeps the compatibility with FusionInventory for GLPI plugin.","moniker":"glpi-agent","name":"GLPI Agent","packageUrl":"https://github.com/glpi-project/glpi-agent/releases/","publisher":"Teclib'","publisherUrl":"https://glpi-project.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/glpi-project/glpi-agent/blob/HEAD/Changes","tags":["glpi"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.21/app.json","detailSha256":"e01f5710cb9234c9e5b71985bcd094fb57156e5554afaecd9fae48c3e5184ff4","releaseDate":"2026-10-08","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.21"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.20/app.json","detailSha256":"b7fbbc7dd5d346448dc41dbd43fb2167ccdd6613a3db523c39dada2f583a74f2","releaseDate":"2026-09-24","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.20"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.19/app.json","detailSha256":"7d13de0c5a9d1338b1a0ba1d71e3e89c68c37ef62ae5abc716c250b1697ab1cf","releaseDate":"2026-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.19"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.18/app.json","detailSha256":"48d179c7d76e4e8